1
00:00:00,031 --> 00:00:02,401
(Raj:)And I'm from India, so I know how to do it.

2
00:00:05,537 --> 00:00:06,597
(Raj:)Okay.

3
00:00:06,771 --> 00:00:09,331
Yeah, thank you. This means a lot to me.

4
00:00:09,541 --> 00:00:11,671
(Raj:)My friends are like my family.

5
00:00:11,843 --> 00:00:14,743
(Raj:)Unless you don't like them,
in which case, they're dead to me.

6
00:00:18,116 --> 00:00:21,246
- You ever spent a long time in a boat before?
- Yeah.

7
00:00:21,419 --> 00:00:25,249
(Bernadette:)Are you referring to the time we got stuck
on the Small World ride at Disneyland?

8
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:28,461
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

9
00:00:31,162 --> 00:00:32,352
(Howard:)I'm proud of you, Leonard.

10
00:00:32,564 --> 00:00:36,934
Working out on the North Sea for months?
That's really something.

11
00:00:37,101 --> 00:00:38,121
(Leonard:)I know.

12
00:00:38,303 --> 00:00:41,203
(Leonard:)As far as science goes,
this is the adventure of a lifetime.

13
00:00:41,372 --> 00:00:44,602
Ha, ha. Maybe your lifetime, I went to space.

14
00:00:47,212 --> 00:00:48,372
(Leonard:)It's not a competition.

15
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,880
(Howard:)You're right, you're right.

16
00:00:50,081 --> 00:00:53,951
(Howard:)I'm really proud of you,
and I'm gonna miss you when you're gone.

17
00:00:54,385 --> 00:00:56,585
(Howard:)And space beats water.

18
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:01,480
(Amy:)Rajesh, I thought Lucy was coming.

